<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls eight points to 839.9.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls eight points to 839.9.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 8.0 points on Monday to 839.9, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Nine of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the transport and telecommunications index losing the most, down 17.5 points to 1,187.0.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
